+    # ── kerchunk_netcdf4 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+    # Virtual Zarr: a NetCDF4 file using the HDF5 filter pipeline (shuffle +
+    # deflate + fletcher32) indexed by VirtualiZarr into a kerchunk JSON manifest.
